  "description": "A production-ready .NET library for Replicate AI API integration. Generate AI images and videos using models like Stable Diffusion XL, HiDream, Google Veo 3, Kling, Luma Ray, and more. Includes ready-to-use MAUI controls for iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS, or use the API-only package for console apps, ASP.NET Core, and Blazor. Features: model presets, prediction tracking, BYOK support, localization (8 languages), and webhook integration.",
